{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "7bcdcbe9-dabb-498c-ba37-181f5cb0be01",
            "index": 0,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3188",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "东西都齐了，幸好帮了那位摊主还有那个工作人员。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7495.2001953125,
            "positionY": 184.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "951a7d83-2613-4eeb-bea0-8907af048db1",
            "index": 1,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3189",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "嘿咻。灭火器我放到这里了。我们要这些东西干什么啊？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 7824.0,
            "positionY": 185.60000610351563,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "04720d73-94e5-499f-8f94-81d75f2ba4e7",
            "index": 2,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3190",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "刚才我在周边遇到了一位本地木偶匠人，他用来制作木偶的丝线和我之前在飞机上看到的非常类似。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8141.60009765625,
            "positionY": 186.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "0abbb66e-c7bb-4419-a4da-7920ebb34b11",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3191",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "这种丝线材质类似蛛丝，遇热会融化，遇冷会脆化。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8472.0,
            "positionY": 187.1999969482422,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "affb42e6-7db6-462f-832f-ead73bd9f82a",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3192",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "对了，那些人身体里被植入了丝线！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 8800.7998046875,
            "positionY": 186.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c760e8bf-f9f5-41b8-ad65-16268d086b42",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3193",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "是的，我们不能在飞机里放火，但却可以在不威胁飞机安全的情况下降温。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 9118.400390625,
            "positionY": 188.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "5fccdb29-0841-4fd9-8e15-f35ded6018d6",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3194",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "花灯摊位有纸制品且靠近热源，属于易引发火灾的摊位类型。所以摊位里配备了不少二氧化碳灭火器。这种灭火器可以在飞机内小范围使用，能够快速降温。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 9436.7998046875,
            "positionY": 186.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "589cb3b1-eabf-4ecb-b061-ec7a9d6a9ae8",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3195",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "啊！只要我们拿这个喷飞机上被控制的人——",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 9755.2001953125,
            "positionY": 186.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "d7652774-a5d1-4d9d-b69b-c96f866a22be",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3196",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "是的，我推测应该可以令他们暂时失去行动能力！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 10073.6005859375,
            "positionY": 187.1999969482422,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "9d1ade86-6eea-45a2-8776-c9a89a4b1127",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3197",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "哈哈！你真是太厉害了！师父果然是对的！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 10392.0,
            "positionY": 186.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a39c410e-e2ce-4478-b642-837290a9034a",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3198",
            "content": {
                "en": "",
                "zh": "欸，那这个音响是做什么的？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 10710.400390625,
            "positionY": 186.40000915527345,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
